{
  "Title": "ELSA-2026-102869:  ruby:3.3 security, bug fix, and enhancement update (CRITICAL)",
  "Description": "ruby\n[3.3.14-11]\n- Rebase to Ruby 3.3.14.\n  Resolves: RHEL-312526\n- Fix Heap buffer overflow in case conversion of strings (CVE-2026-132825).\n  Resolves: RHEL-312279\n\n[3.3.13-10]\n- Rebase to Ruby 3.3.13.\n  Resolves: RHEL-313262\n- Fix: integer overflow issue in regular expression compiler (CVE-2026-110264)\n  Resolves: RHEL-292084\n- Fix: integer overflow issue in CI/CD regular expression compiler (CVE-2026-97229)\n  Resolves: RHEL-292113\n- Fix: integer overflow issue in regular expression compiler (CVE-2026-93577)\n  Resolves: RHEL-292143\n- Fix: double free issue in regular expression parser (CVE-2026-89078)\n  Resolves: RHEL-292217\n\nrubygem-mysql2\n[0.5.5-3]\n- Disable tests on the 32bit platforms ix86.\n  Related: RHEL-80222\n\n[0.5.5-2]\n- Adapt tests to openssl 3.2\n  Resolves: RHEL-80222\n\n[0.5.5-1]\n- Upgrade to mysql2 0.5.5.\n  Related: RHEL-17089\n\nrubygem-pg\n[-1.5.4-2]\n- Fix encoding issue in spec suite.\n  Resolves: RHEL-159199",
  "Platform": [
    "Oracle Linux 9"
